1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,528
Your brain can't stop reading. Let me prove it.

2
00:00:03,548 --> 00:00:06,963
Don't read the word. Say the color of the letters.

3
00:00:06,983 --> 00:00:11,849
This says red... but the letters are green. So you say: green.

4
00:00:11,899 --> 00:00:13,280
Sounds easy.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:17,046
People have been failing this test since 1935.

6
00:00:17,066 --> 00:00:19,866
Three levels. Each one faster than the last.

7
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:22,907
Say every color out loud, before the bar runs out.

8
00:00:22,927 --> 00:00:25,373
Level one. Go!

9
00:00:33,773 --> 00:00:36,603
Easy, right? That's because two of them matched.

10
00:00:36,623 --> 00:00:39,752
Here's the trap: you can't stop reading.

11
00:00:39,772 --> 00:00:41,887
Level two. Faster.

12
00:00:41,907 --> 00:00:44,280
None of them match. Go!

13
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:54,285
Did you feel that tiny pause before every color?

14
00:00:54,305 --> 00:00:57,876
Reading is automatic. Naming a color isn't.

15
00:00:57,896 --> 00:01:00,177
So reading always gets there first.

16
00:01:00,197 --> 00:01:04,503
In 1935, people were almost twice as slow when the word lied.

17
00:01:04,523 --> 00:01:07,033
And it only works because you can read.

18
00:01:07,053 --> 00:01:09,761
Little kids who can't read yet? They don't fall for it.

19
00:01:09,781 --> 00:01:12,223
Final level. The fastest.

20
00:01:12,243 --> 00:01:15,047
And this time... I'll read the words to you. Go!

21
00:01:15,197 --> 00:01:22,647
Red. Green. Brown. Blue. Purple. Red. Blue. Green.

22
00:01:23,047 --> 00:01:23,692
Stop!

23
00:01:23,712 --> 00:01:25,970
How many did you get right? Be honest.

24
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:27,486
Drop your score in the comments!

25
00:01:27,506 --> 00:01:31,252
Nineteen out of nineteen? I don't believe you.

